WEBVTT

00:00:05.591 --> 00:00:11.591
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:14.682 --> 00:00:20.682
Type "Decimals" in the Search box.

00:00:24.175 --> 00:00:30.175
Click Edit Decimals at the Market.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:39.670
Scroll to Home preview clip on the right.

00:00:44.103 --> 00:00:50.103
Check the Preview clip
badge and the note under it.

00:00:55.876 --> 00:01:01.876
Click Retry under the options.

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:10.833
Wait until the badge says Queued.
